    "detailed_description": "After their car breaks down, a group of teens find themselves trapped in the clutches of an ancient evil! They must fight against dark forces and find out the truth before it's too late... <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom Rosaceae Games comes a homage to classic survival horror. Battle your way through dangerous enemies in a top down perspective, and put your brain to the test solving puzzles and challenges to progress. All wrapped up in a branching story with multiple choices and endings,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes:<br />\r\n-top down shooter gameplay with multiple weapons.<br />\r\n-survival horror elements. Limited resources, confined spaces, and terrifying enemies.<br />\r\n-engaging puzzles and tests of your ingenuity<br />\r\n-branching storyline with multiple choices, and real consequences.<br />\r\n-detailed Pixel art cutscenes to tell a mysterious, and horrifying story",
